{"ref":"BDB, צִיר²","hw":"צִיר²","html":"† II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">צִיר</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Proverbs 25:13\" href=\"/Proverbs.25.13\">Pr 25:13</a></sup> <strong>envoy, messenger</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">צ׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 49:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.49.14\">Je 49:14</a> +, cstr. <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 13:17\" href=\"/Proverbs.13.17\">Pr 13:17</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">צִירִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 18:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.18.2\">Is 18:2</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">צִרַיִךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 57:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.57.9\">57:9</a>;—<em>envoy</em>, from Cush <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 18:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.18.2\">Is 18:2</a>, from apostate Isr. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 57:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.57.9\">57:9</a>; from <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 49:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.49.14\">Je 49:14</a> = <a data-ref=\"Obadiah 1:1\" href=\"/Obadiah.1.1\">Ob 1</a>; <em>messenger</em> in gen. <span dir=\"rtl\">צִיר אֱמוּנִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 13:17\" href=\"/Proverbs.13.17\">Pr 13:17</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">צ׳ נֶאֱמָן</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 25:13\" href=\"/Proverbs.25.13\">25:13</a>.—i. <span dir=\"rtl\">צִיר</span> v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, צוּר³\" href=\"/BDB,_צוּר³\", dir=\"rtl\">IV. צור</a>.","next":"BDB, ציר²","prev":"BDB, ציר"}